@* =================================================================
   _ValidationScriptsPartial.cshtml
   
   Include on any page with a form that needs validation.
   These scripts enable CLIENT-SIDE validation — errors show
   instantly without a server round-trip.
   
   How it works:
   ASP.NET Tag Helpers render data-val-* attributes on inputs.
   jquery.validate reads those attributes and shows errors.
   Server-side validation still runs as a backup.
   ================================================================= *@

<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation/dist/jquery.validate.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation-unobtrusive/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js"></script>